demo_type: MULTICOL
title: "Column Rule"
target_base_style: "column-count: 3; column-gap: 24px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.6; color: #c0c8d4;"
target_inner_html: "Column rules create visual separators between columns. The column-rule shorthand sets width, style, and color in one declaration. Rules sit in the column gap and do not affect content width or layout flow. Different combinations produce distinct visual effects."
